#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use IBM Cloud to manage users with IBM Cloud accounts"
msgstr "Cara menggunakan IBM Cloud untuk mengelola pengguna dengan akun IBM Cloud"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users"
msgstr "Kelola pengguna IBM Cloud"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"
msgstr "Kelola pengguna IBM Cloud {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates how to use IBM Cloud&reg; to enable users who have IBM Cloud accounts and gives instructions for users to access the environment.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan IBM Cloud&reg; untuk mengaktifkan pengguna yang memiliki akun IBM Cloud dan memberikan instruksi bagi pengguna untuk mengakses lingkungan tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To manage ID provider users instead, follow the instructions in the [Manage ID providers](/guides/manage-appid) topic.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengelola pengguna ID provider, ikuti instruksi di topik [Kelola ID providers](/guides/manage-appid).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps {#steps}"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah {#steps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these high-level steps to manage IBM Cloud users:\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk mengelola pengguna IBM Cloud:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that the users that you want to invite have IBM Cloud accounts.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan pengguna yang ingin kamu undang sudah memiliki akun IBM Cloud.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to IAM and [invite users](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Users cannot be managed until they accept the invitation and log in at least once.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka IAM dan [undang pengguna](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Pengguna tidak bisa dikelola sampai mereka menerima undangan dan masuk setidaknya sekali.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Modify users' project assignments and access groups from [IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users).\n"
msgstr "Opsional: Modifikasi penetapan proyek dan grup akses pengguna dari [IAM.](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "User flow {#user-flow}"
msgstr "Alur pengguna {#user-flow}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user accepts an invitation, then logs on through the [IBM Cloud portal](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr "Pengguna menerima undangan, lalu masuk melalui [portal IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user creates an API key by going to ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"
msgstr "Pengguna membuat API key dengan membuka ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For further information, users can review [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, pengguna bisa membaca [Install Qiskit.](/guides/install-qiskit)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example scenario {#example-scenario}"
msgstr "Contoh skenario {#example-scenario}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example creates the following setup:\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini membuat pengaturan berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two projects, `ml` and `finance`.\n"
msgstr "Ada dua proyek, `ml` dan `finance`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` project should have access to the service instances `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Proyek `ml` harus bisa mengakses instans layanan `QR-ml` dan `QR-common`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` project should have access to the service instances `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Proyek `finance` harus bisa mengakses instans layanan `QR-finance` dan `QR-common`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three users:\n"
msgstr "Ada tiga pengguna:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima should have access to the `ml` project.\n"
msgstr "Fatima harus bisa mengakses proyek `ml`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi should have access to the `finance` project.\n"
msgstr "Ravi harus bisa mengakses proyek `finance`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra should have access to both projects.\n"
msgstr "Amyra harus bisa mengakses kedua proyek.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "It uses access groups without resource groups.\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan grup akses tanpa grup sumber daya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users are defined in IBM Cloud and project assignments are done there as well.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna didefinisikan di IBM Cloud dan penetapan proyek dilakukan di sana juga.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users should be able to delete jobs.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna harus bisa menghapus jobs.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The steps to implement this setup are:\n"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah untuk mengimplementasikan pengaturan ini adalah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates three service instances: `QR-ml`, `QR finance`, and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Administrator Cloud membuat tiga instans layanan: `QR-ml`, `QR finance`, dan `QR-common`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates a custom rule that includes the `quantum-computing.job.delete` action.\n"
msgstr "Administrator Cloud membuat aturan kustom yang menyertakan aksi `quantum-computing.job.delete`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates two access groups:\n"
msgstr "Administrator Cloud membuat dua grup akses:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` access group can access `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Grup akses `ml` bisa mengakses `QR-ml` dan `QR-common`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` access group can access `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Grup akses `finance` bisa mengakses `QR-finance` dan `QR-common`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator invites cloud users to the appropriate project. Specifically, they invite and assign users to an access group that includes the project.\n"
msgstr "Administrator Cloud mengundang pengguna cloud ke proyek yang sesuai. Secara khusus, mereka mengundang dan menetapkan pengguna ke grup akses yang mencakup proyek tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima is added to the \"ml\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Fatima ditambahkan ke grup akses \"ml\".\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi is added to the \"finance\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Ravi ditambahkan ke grup akses \"finance\".\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra is added to both the \"ml\" and \"finance\" access groups.\n"
msgstr "Amyra ditambahkan ke grup akses \"ml\" dan \"finance\".\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users can log in through the IBM Cloud portal, create API keys, and work with their projects' service instances.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna bisa masuk melalui portal IBM Cloud, membuat API keys, dan bekerja dengan instans layanan proyek mereka.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"   * Lihat [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"
"   * Rujuk ke [dokumentasi App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started) lengkap.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
